sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Worker
    actor Manager
    participant Floor as Production Floor
    participant Notebook as Paper Notebook

    Worker->>Floor: Detect quality issue
    Worker->>Notebook: Write product, date, quantity
    Note over Notebook: Inconsistent format, no batch code on every run

    Worker->>Manager: Inform manager verbally
    Manager->>Manager: Review defect informally
    Manager->>Worker: Decide corrective action without assignment

    Worker->>Floor: Perform physical action on floor
    Manager->>Floor: May assist with corrective action

    opt Loss recording
        Manager->>Notebook: Note defective units manually
    end

    Manager->>Manager: Optional informal verification
    Note over Worker,Manager: No structured workflow or management report

    Manager->>Notebook: File paper record locally
    Note over Notebook: Case closed informally, defects may recur
